      "unrated_positions": [],
      "not_audited_positions": [],
      "key_excerpt": "To meet the needs of the film industry, Flawless has been created in close collaboration with guilds, unions, studios, and post-production partners. Clear Rights, No Gray Zones. Our models are built with rights and provenance in mind. [...] Informed Consent by Design. The Artistic Rights Treasury (A.R.T.) ensures that when AI assists in refining a performance, the actor reviews and consents to every change before release.",
