      "key_excerpt": "First, the AI analyzes the original film frame-by-frame. It places thousands of invisible tracking points over the actor's face, mapping the precise geometry of the jawline, lips, teeth, and cheeks. This completely isolates the \"performance zone\" from the rest of the head.",
